Receptionist voice improvements: British accent and voice previews

Backend changes (receptionist_api.py):
- Strengthen British accent instruction in system prompt with
  detailed pronunciation, vocabulary, and phrasing rules placed
  prominently before CORE IDENTITY section
- Add GET /v1/receptionist/voices/{voice_id}/preview endpoint that
  generates MP3 audio via OpenAI TTS with in-memory caching
- Update AVAILABLE_VOICES with UK-friendly descriptions and
  recommended flag for Shimmer and Ballad
- Add preview text for each voice

Frontend changes:
- ReceptionistTab: replace disabled Preview button with working
  audio playback (play/stop toggle), add recommended badge to
  voice dropdown items, add preview to setup wizard
- AdminOnboardingWizard: add voice preview button and recommended
  badges to receptionist step voice selector
- design-system.css: add voice-preview-btn styles with playing state
